<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Document</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <h1 style="font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 48px; margin-bottom: 0;">DAEMEN</h1>
    <p style="font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 5px;">Health and Insurance Services</p>
  </div>
  <p style="margin-top: 40px;"><span data-field="date">{{ date }}</span></p>
  <p>To: Students, Faculty and Staff</p>
  <p>From: <span data-field="sender.name">{{ sender.name }}</span>, Coordinator for Health & Wellness Education</p>
  <p>Subject: Coronavirus and Spring Break Travel</p>
  <p>Dear Daemen Community,</p>
  <p>We are continuing efforts to closely monitor the Novel Coronavirus. While the virus has been suspected to be present in the United States, there are currently <span data-field="status">{{ status }}</span> of the Coronavirus on <span data-field="campus_name">{{ campus_name }}</span>. With Spring break and possible travel around the corner, I wanted to reach out and share tips to keep you healthy!</p>

  <h2 style="font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px;">CDC RECOMMENDATIONS:</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Avoid close contact with people who are sick</li>
    <li>Cover your mouth and nose with a tissue (or elbow) when coughing or sneezing</li>
    <li>Avoid touching your eyes, nose, and mouth</li>
    <li>Clean and disinfect frequently touched objects and surfaces</li>
    <li>Stay home when you are sick, except to receive medical care</li>
    <li>Wash your hands often with soap and water for at least 20 seconds (and/or use hand sanitizer when available)</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 style="font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px;">WELLNESS REMINDERS:</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Spring Flu Shot Clinic: <span data-field="clinic_date">{{ clinic_date }}</span>, <span data-field="clinic_time">{{ clinic_time }}</span>, <span data-field="clinic_location">{{ clinic_location }}</span></li>
    <li>Wellness Kiosk: FREE wellness products are available to students in the <span data-field="kiosk_location">{{ kiosk_location }}</span>! Products include but are not limited to: cold & cough medicine, pain relief medicine, cough drops, vitamin C drops and disposable thermometers. The kiosk is available in the Health Services Office, <span data-field="kiosk_address">{{ kiosk_address }}</span> during office hours: <span data-field="kiosk_hours">{{ kiosk_hours }}</span>.</li>
    <li>Free Urgent Care Transportation: Students can contact Daemen College Campus Safety by phone at <span data-field="safety_phone">{{ safety_phone }}</span> [SAFE] or visit the desk in Wick Lobby and request FREE transport to one of two Urgent Care locations (within 1 mile of campus).</li>
  </ul>

  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">At this time, the CDC recommends that travelers avoid all nonessential travel to <span data-field="travel_destination">{{ travel_destination }}</span>. The CDC has also issued travel notices that are based on assessment of the potential health risks involved with traveling to a certain area.</p>

  <p style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <span data-field="mailing_address">{{ mailing_address }}</span> • Phone: <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span> • Fax: <span data-field="fax">{{ fax }}</span><br>
    Email: <span data-field="email">{{ email }}</span>
  </p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <h1 style="font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 48px; margin-bottom: 0;">DAEMEN</h1>
    <p style="font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 5px;">Health and Insurance Services</p>
  </div>
  <p style="margin-top: 40px;">For more information visit: <a href="http://www.cdc.gov/coronavirus" style="color: #000;">Coronavirus Disease 2019 Information for Travel</a>. As the situation evolves, the College may need to screen individuals returning from other countries in accordance with updated <a href="http://www.cdc.gov/travel" style="color: #000;">CDC Travel Guidelines</a>. For more information, please review the resources that are listed below and attached to this email:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Visit <a href="http://www.cdc.gov/coronavirus" style="color: #000;">cdc.gov/coronavirus</a></li>
    <li>Call the Novel Coronavirus Hotline: <span data-field="hotline_number">{{ hotline_number }}</span></li>
    <li>Contact Health Services: <span data-field="health_email">{{ health_email }}</span> or Wick 116, CHIP Center</li>
  </ul>
  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">Well wishes for a safe and healthy spring break!</p>
  <p>Ashley</p>

  <p style="margin-top: 80px;">
    <span data-field="mailing_address_2">{{ mailing_address_2 }}</span> • Phone: <span data-field="phone_2">{{ phone_2 }}</span> • Fax: <span data-field="fax_2">{{ fax_2 }}</span><br>
    Email: <span data-field="email_2">{{ email_2 }}</span>
  </p>
</div>
</body>
</html>